================================================================================
NOTICE -- Vendored napari progressive-loading engine
================================================================================

The Python modules in this directory (`_progressive_loading.py`,
`_virtual_data.py`, `_texture_swap.py`, `_glir_metering.py`,
`_debug_overlay.py`) are vendored, unmodified except for import rewrites and an
attribution header, from the napari project.

Source
------
Project : napari (github.com/napari/napari)
Pull    : #9067 -- "Progressive loading" (github.com/napari/napari/pull/9067)
Head    : kephale/napari @ 07e4f3fcfb602878a864aa0de4d9b08bf5a9a2f7
Branch  : progressive-loading-rebase (rebased onto post-0.8.0 napari main)
Fetched : 2026-08-02

Only intra-package imports were rewritten to relative form (e.g.
`from napari.experimental._virtual_data import X` -> `from ._virtual_data import
X`). All `from napari.*` and `from vispy.*` imports are unchanged and resolve to
the installed packages. A short attribution header was prepended to each file.

This is a TEMPORARY in-tree copy. DELETE this directory when napari-core ships
progressive loading in a released version and depend on the upstream API
instead.

